      "url": "https://github.com/storytold/craft-anything/compare/main...Afloat16:craft-anything:bugfix/r3.12-bzip2-concatenated-members-20261111?expand=1&title=Recover%20every%20concatenated%20bzip2%20member%20within%20one%20output%20budget%20(R3.12)&body=%23%23%20Problem%0A%0AThe%20existing%20bzip2%20decoder%20returns%20the%20first%20member%20of%20a%20concatenated%20stream.%20Recovery%20can%20silently%20omit%20later%20content%2C%20accept%20a%20damaged%20later%20member%2C%20or%20apply%20the%20output%20budget%20only%20to%20the%20first%20member.%20ZIP%20method%2012%20uses%20the%20same%20public%20decoder.%0A%0A%23%23%20Change%0A%0A-%20Decode%20each%20member%20in%20order%20with%20one%20shared%20bounded%20output%20sink%2C%20including%20empty%20members.%0A-%20Check%20each%20member's%20block%20and%20combined%20checksums%20and%20reject%20unfinished%20members%20instead%20of%20returning%20the%20earlier%20valid%20prefix.%0A-%20Keep%20firmware-carving%20compatibility%20with%20non-member%20bytes%20after%20a%20complete%20stream.%20Invalid%20initial%20input%20and%20a%20truncated%20next-member%20header%20remain%20errors.%0A-%20Use%20the%20safe%20%60bzip2%3A%3Abufread%3A%3ABzDecoder%60%20interface%2C%20whose%20returned%20input%20exposes%20the%20exact%20remaining%20bytes.%20The%20previous%20%60bzip2-rs%60%20interface%20did%20not%20expose%20unused%20buffered%20input.%0A-%20Resolve%20%60bzip2%200.6.1%60%20with%20its%20default%20pure%20Rust%20%60libbz2-rs-sys%200.2.6%60%20backend.%20No%20C%20backend%20is%20enabled.%20Cargo%20adds%20only%20these%20two%20packages%20and%20removes%20the%20old%20decoder%20and%20its%20now-unused%20%60tinyvec%60%20leaf%20dependency%3B%20existing%20package%20versions%20do%20not%20change.%0A%0AThe%20public%20result%2Ferror%20types%20and%20output%20limit%20are%20unchanged.%20Concatenated%20streams%20are%20part%20of%20the%20%5Bbzip2%20format's%20supported%20behavior%5D(https%3A%2F%2Fsourceware.org%2Fbzip2%2Fmanual%2Fmanual.html).%0A%0A%23%23%20Validation%0A%0AThe